WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.051 --> 00:00:06.037
A mountain of cards, and Maya can sort one card at a time!

3
00:00:06.552 --> 00:00:08.568
The sun is going down!

4
00:00:09.082 --> 00:00:12.349
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:15.234
This is Episode 84.

6
00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:17.612
Meet the ant crew.

7
00:00:18.127 --> 00:00:21.759
Hundreds of tiny ants, each one carries one card.

8
00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:26.448
Cups to the red mat, lemons to the yellow, suns to the blue.

9
00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:28.944
All at the same time.

10
00:00:29.459 --> 00:00:31.228
The mountain melts.

11
00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:33.441
Need it faster?

12
00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:36.314
Clap, and more ants come.

13
00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.043
Done?

14
00:00:38.558 --> 00:00:40.233
They march home.

15
00:00:40.748 --> 00:00:43.024
You only pay while they work.

16
00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.779
That is Amazon EMR.

17
00:00:46.293 --> 00:00:51.034
A big crew of helpers that chews through a mountain of data together, then goes away.

18
00:00:51.549 --> 00:00:53.601
Now you know the ant crew!

19
00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

